      "amount": "400ml"
    },
    {
      "name": "Almonds, slivered (optional)",
      "amount": "50g"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kosher salt",
      "amount": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fresh parsley, chopped",
      "amount": "2 tbsp"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a large saucepan or wok, heat the olive oil over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and onion; sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ginger, red pepper flakes, tomato paste, and vegetable broth. Simmer for 2-3 minutes to let flavors meld.",
    "Fold in the frozen seafood mix. Stir well until all pieces are coated with sauce.",
    "Sprinkle the slivered almonds on top if using, then season with salt to taste.",
    "Let simmer for another minute or two until most of the liquid is absorbed and the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Stir in fresh parsley just before serving."
  ],
